# MarineDebrisAI - Environment Configuration

# Backend API Base URL
# - Local development: Leave empty (Vite proxies /api to http://127.0.0.1:8000)
# - Vercel single-project deployment: Leave empty (calls relative /api on the same domain)
# - Dedicated Python Backend (Render / Railway / Fly.io / AWS): Set to your deployed backend URL
# Example: VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://marine-debris-backend.onrender.com
VITE_API_BASE_URL=
